      means: >-
        Claude's reply in the conversation either lists exactly a stated
        number of headings, in document order, or is exactly a stated
        message.
      terms: [outline]
```

with this concept entry:

```yaml
    - concept: reply
      means: >-
        Claude's reply in the conversation is one of these: it lists exactly
        a stated number of headings, in document order; or it is exactly a
        stated message; or it offers to summarise the Google Doc instead.
      terms: [Google Doc, outline]
```

